<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan one-month NCDs single yield at 6.500 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan one-month NCDs single yield at 6.500 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$5 billion in one-month negotiable certificates of deposit on Wednesday at a single yield of 6.500 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$9.5 billion.</p>
<p>The central bank has said its recent series of NCD issues aimed to absorb banking system's extra money, but not to dampen stock market turnover as many analysts have asserted.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
